{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15213590","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15213590","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1521359001:0":{"text":"Did you hear anything about Marco? Is... is he okay?","source_cn":"你们打听到马尔科的消息了吗？他……他还好吗？<key:...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF6784F085B8CBE06","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1521359002:0":{"text":"He was hurt in battle. He's still recovering at the camp.","source_cn":"他在战场上受了伤，现在还在军营里接受治疗。<key:d...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF1D91E3772F94516","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1521359003:0":{"text":"He wrote you a letter. Asked us to bring it to you.","source_cn":"他写了一封信，托我们转交给你。<key:dialog2>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x06825BE7023DFDBB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1521359004:0":{"text":"Oh, thank goodness he's okay... Let me see it.","source_cn":"没事就好，没事就好……我看看他的信。<key:dial...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCBCBE9830B9E73AA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1521359005:0":{"text":"Fufu takes the letter. But as her eyes move across the page, the color drains from her face.","source_cn":"芙接过马尔科写的信。但很快，她的脸色就变得苍白。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE099890A1F7657FD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1521359006:0":{"text":"What did he say?","source_cn":"他写了什么？<key:dialog52>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x60A6910871F27001","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1521359007:0":{"text":"He... he wrote about the Hunting Goddess and the Halian general...","source_cn":"他……他写了狩猎神和呼临统帅的故事……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x836957A0E3A488C5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1521359008:0":{"text":"He said love between different races is doomed… and he wants me to just...","source_cn":"他说，跨越种族的爱情注定不会善终……所以让我……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x584427DF0553F060","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1521359009:0":{"text":"I... I...","source_cn":"我……我……<key:dialog5>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6FE167E327954FB7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1521359010:0":{"text":"Are you alright?","source_cn":"你还好吗？<key:dialog55>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDCAF8DB0E37EA855","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":""